    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "O'Connell Properties are delighted to bring to the market 39 Faussagh Avenue, Cabra, Dublin 7. This is a beautiful 2-bedroom terraced family home with front garden and sunny well maintained back garden. A fantastic location on the City end of Cabra and only 1km to the Phoenix Park and c.3 Kms to the City Centre.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation extends to c.64 sq. meters and comprises on ground floor an entrance hall, large bright living room and kitchen/dining room. Upstairs has 2 double bedrooms and the main family bathroom. \r\n\r\nThis is a highly desirable mature residential location convenient to numerous city centre bus routes and walking distance to the local Luas station. The property is convenient to the Phoenix Park and close to shops, schools and transport links. There are also numerous social, sporting and recreational clubs/facilities in the local community and an excellent choice of national and secondary schools.\r\n\r\n\"Whilst every care has been taken in the preparation of these particulars, and they are believed to be correct, they are not warranted and intended purchasers/lessees should satisfy themselves as to the correctness of the information given\"."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground floor:\r\nLiving room: 3.22m x 3.12m with feature fireplace\r\n\r\nKitchen/dining room: 4.86m x 3.4m with modern shaker style kitchen,brick splash backs and flooring and door to back garden\r\n\r\nFirst floor:\r\nMaster Bedroom : 4m x 3.3m Large double bedroom \r\n\r\nBedroom 2: 3.1m x 2.86m Double bedroom \r\n\r\nBathroom: 1.49m x 1.9m Shower,  WHB and WC"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Front garden and Large, bright and sunny back garden\r\nSignificant potential to extend at the rear of property\r\nFantastic and much sought after location, walking distance to Luas station, close to the wonderful Phoenix Park and Dublin City Centre\r\nExcellent choice of local national and secondary schools\r\nVibrant local community with many sporting and recreational clubs/facilities available in the local community"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: E2"
      }
    ],
